      "simplified": "她的家人都在家，弟弟在看iPad，妈妈在喝水，谢叔叔在工作。",
      "traditional": "她的家人都在家，弟弟在看iPad，媽媽在喝水，謝叔叔在工作。",
      "pinyin": "tā de jiā rén dōu zài jiā dì di zài kàn 1 mā ma zài hē shuǐ xiè shū shu zài gōng zuò",
      "english": "Her family were all home. Her little brother was looking at the iPad, her mom was drinking water, and Uncle Xie was working."
    },
    {
