      "pinyin": "xiè shū shu bú shì qián duō duō de bà ba",
      "english": "Uncle Xie was not Qian Duoduo’s father."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "钱多多的妈妈和爸爸不在一起了，现在妈妈和谢叔叔在一起。",
