    "sentence_translations": [
      "(4) You’re the Big Sister",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo was no longer tired. She went home at 9 o’clock in the evening.",
      "",
      "Her family were all home. Her little brother was looking at the iPad, her mom was drinking water, and Uncle Xie was working.",
      "",
      "Uncle Xie was not Qian Duoduo’s father.",
      "Qian Duoduo’s mom and dad were no longer together. Now, her mom and Uncle Xie were together.",
      "After they got together, they had their own child. This child was Qian Duoduo’s little brother.",
      "",
      "Her little brother was 6 years old. After they had her little brother, her mom liked to say, “You’re the big sister.”",
      "",
      "“You’re the big sister. How about we give this iPad to your little brother?”",
      "",
      "“You’re the big sister. You take care of your little brother.”",
      "",
      "“You’re the big sister. Your little brother likes to eat this, so how about we eat it today?”",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo knew that she was the big sister.",
      "She also really liked her little brother, but she didn’t like these four words: You’re the big sister."
    ]
  }
